{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105585","id":2470098347,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6TOrWr","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105585","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105585.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105585.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105585","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105585/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105585/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105585/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ed0690dc4403b78bafe975bf493048de8d0851a2","number":105585,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[Web] Prevent unnecessary canvas resizes by flooring scaled dimensions","user":{"login":"marcosc90","id":8364242,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNjQyNDI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8364242?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90","html_url":"https://github.com/marcosc90","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"`GodotDisplayScreen.updateSize()` was triggering canvas resizes on every frame due to fractional dimensions, leading to repeated [`emscripten_set_canvas_element_size` calls and unnecessary GL redraws](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2d3bdcac35ac22ee6c4d5d5edc88ba947d0659d5/platform/web/display_server_web.cpp#L59-L60).\r\n\r\nSince `canvas.width` and `canvas.height` must be integers, both the canvas size and CSS size are now explicitly floored to avoid floating-point mismatches.\r\n\r\n![Screenshot from 2025-04-20 16-56-55](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4ad8fb63-dd1f-4cae-ab15-402b79687b40)\r\n\r\nThis reduces frame time by **0.75-2ms** on my computer.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nIn my case it was always doing this check:\r\n```\r\n2559 != 2559.599932193756 \r\n```","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097455,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc0NTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:web","name":"platform:web","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state"